    "cwe_ids": [],
    "description": "### Impact\r\nUsers with only \"See\" permission on a restricted category could receive new chat messages from that category's chat channel in real time, even though they are not allowed to join the channel or read its history.\r\n\r\nThis only affects sites with a chat channel on a restricted category where at least one group has \"See\" permission without \"Reply\" or \"Create\". It does not allow posting, moderation, or access to earlier messages.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nRemove \"See\"-only groups from the security settings of restricted categories that have a chat channel.",
